This plan must be read together with Inner West LEP 2022. The LEP prevails if there is any inconsistency. This DCP should also be read in conjunction with the following: Environmental Planning and Assessment Act, 1979; Environmental Planning and Assessment Regulation 2000; Relevant State Environmental Planning Policies (SEPP’s)\*\*   
